{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はおいでシャンプー発売記念と言うことで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメーバの生放送に出演しましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＭＣのロッチさんとおしゃべりしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2335136/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったわず!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使っているシャンプーについて紹介したよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみさんに教えてもらったシャンプーでね、うちの髪の毛昔はくりんくりんだったのだけど、あまり寝癖がひどくなくなったんよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2335136/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと暴露大会をやりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂４６仲良すぎてね〜(´∀｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっかいだしたくなっちゃうのよね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ沢山楽しかったけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力でアイーンをしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た方はわかると思いますが、とても変だったと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おもしろい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思った方は思い出し笑いや、なんかおもしろい気持ちになりたいときに活用してください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思った方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直ぐに忘れてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その方が身のためです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくださったみなさん!!本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いいたします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近暑くなってきましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちもう耐えられません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑すぎます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田は夏でもあんまり暑くないのに..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の夏は怖いです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2335136/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2335136/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2335136/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2335136/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2335136/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2335136/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2335136/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2335136/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2335136/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/05/2335136/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/m